Z||000005||Shiner||09-20-2000||12:25 AM||||Me and my brother decied to see what my mother's company car, an automatic 4 door neon, was made of.  Handling was very spooky when approching the limits.  It would only chirp the tires if you powerbraked it like you hated it.  And once it got up to 70mph at full open throttle, it just pooped out.  My Isuzu Trooper is faster than that damn thing at 70mph!||||reg||1
Z||000006||Shadow Wolf||09-20-2000||01:37 AM||||I used to drive a Turbo Sprint that didn't crap out until around 110mph/ 190kph... kinda scary at that speed, back end got a little light.||||reg||6
Z||000007||Standard||09-20-2000||01:50 AM||||I'll have to take my mom's neon out for a test drive sometime  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  should try to get my bro in it and have a little race...||||reg||1
